  "claim": "This music channel regularly shows the UK R&B Singles and Albums Charts. The owner of this channel (UK and Ireland) changed it's name in 2004. Their new acronym stand for Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung.",
  "evidencia": "Page: VIVA Media. Sentence: VIVA Media GmbH (until 2004 \"VIVA Media AG\") is a music television network originating from Germany.\nPage: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung. Sentence: A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (] , abbreviated GmbH ] and also GesmbH in Austria) is a type of legal entity very common in Germany, Austria, Switzerland (where it is equivalent to a S.à r.l.) and Liechtenstein.\nPage: Viva (UK and Ireland). Sentence: Viva (stylised as VIVA) is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland, owned by VIVA Media and thereby Viacom International Media Networks Europe.\nPage: UK R&amp;B Singles and Albums Charts. Sentence: The UK R&B chart is also shown regularly on music channels including Kiss, Viva UK, MTV Base and MTV Hits.",
