        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The Box Plus Network, Bauer Media Group, gmbh\n- Products: The Box\n- Topics: UK R&B Singles Chart, UK R&B Albums Chart, channel rebranding\n\nFacts:\n- The Box is a music television channel that regularly shows the UK R&B Singles Chart and the UK R&B Albums Chart.\n- The owner of The Box in the UK and Ireland changed its name in 2004.\n- The owner’s new acronym was gmbh, which stands for Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung.",
