        "original_id": "40349427-c935-5ae5-bed1-0208267e4573",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH, VIVA Media AG\n- Products: Viva, Viva UK\n- Places: Germany, United Kingdom, Ireland, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein\n- Organizations: Viacom International Media Networks Europe\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, GmbH, GesmbH, S.à r.l., UK R&B chart\n- Topics: music television networks, legal entity types, music channels\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH, called VIVA Media AG until 2004, is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, abbreviated GmbH and also GesmbH in Austria, is a common type of legal entity in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to an S.à r.l.\n- Viva, stylised as VIVA, is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland.\n- Viva is owned by VIVA Media and thereby by Viacom International Media Networks Europe.\n- The UK R&B chart is shown regularly on music channels including Kiss, Viva UK, MTV Base, and MTV Hits.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
